{"id":42971,"date":"2025-07-06T21:26:29","date_gmt":"2025-07-06T20:26:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pisao-extreme-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-28T00:01:51","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T23:01:51","slug":"pisao-extreme","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pisao-extreme\/","title":{"rendered":"Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>4 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es no <strong>Parque do Pis\u00e3o, em Carvalhais<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>SpotCriativo Eventos<\/strong> em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul, o evento assume-se como uma das provas de skyrunning mais duras e t\u00e9cnicas de Portugal, tutelada pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o de Campismo e Montanhismo de Portugal (FCMP).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes encarar quatro dist\u00e2ncias de verticalidade e tecnicidade extrema desenhadas em formato circular na imponente <strong>Serra da Arada<\/strong>: o tit\u00e2nico <strong>PEX L de 65 km com 6500m D+<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>06:30<\/strong>), o vertiginoso <strong>PEX M de 35 km com 3600m D+<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong>), o exigente <strong>PEX S de 25 km com 2200m D+<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>) e o explosivo <strong>PEX XS de 16 km com 1000m D+<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura controlo rigoroso com geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o e chips eletr\u00f3nicos, postos de socorro em montanha, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos refor\u00e7ados, t-shirt comemorativa e o conceituado trof\u00e9u\/medalha finisher para quem dominar a m\u00edtica Serra da Arada.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-sn