0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que entidade tutela a componente competitiva da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Pis\u00e3o Extreme \u00e9 um evento oficial de Skyrunning tutelado pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o de Campismo e Montanhismo de Portugal (FCMP).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe material obrigat\u00f3rio para participar na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, devido \u00e0 extrema dureza na Serra da Arada, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito e corta-vento imperme\u00e1vel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e guias da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial detalhado encontra-se dispon\u00edvel em https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/storage\/events\/pisao-extreme-2026\/6a1577143c616_PEX &#8211; regulamento 6.B.pdf.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data